<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on H-shares basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on H-shares basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Intenational &amp; Co C.V. said on Thursday it has launched 300 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five locally-listed Chinese enterprise H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of --</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd	 2.25   shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd		1.5    shares</p>
<p> Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd  0.25   shares</p>
<p> Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd	1.5    shares</p>
<p> Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd    0.5    shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.60	 PREMIUM	 15.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.327	 GEARING	 4.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  05.DEC.97	PAYDATE	 16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$12.88</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
